		<section class="main">
			<div class="scrollable">
				<h1>Help</h1>
				
				<h3>General</h3>
				<p>Overall, Blairpath's interface is designed similarly to Google Maps and Apple Maps.</p>

				<p>Because Blairpath covers multiple floors, <b>press up/down to change the floor</b>.</p>
				
				<p>To move the map, click and drag, or press <code>W</code>/<code>A</code>/<code>S</code>/<code>D</code>.</p>
				
				<h3>Contributing</h3>
				<p>You can suggest changes to Blairpath's map by submitting an issue or pull request on the Blairpath GitHub. A developer will review and (probably) approve it.</p>

				<p>For developers, please read the <a href="http://localhost:5006/devhelp">dev tools tutorial</a>.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</body>
</html>